  "title": "K-On!",
  "justification": "AniDB special S2 \"Live House!\" is TVDB season 0 episode 19 of that title, and S3-S9 are the URA-ON! shorts, episodes 1-7 (\"Yui's Curiosity Series\" to \"Winter's... Chapter\"); S1 \"Winter Days!\" stays on season 1 episode 13. S12-S14 (interviews with the English cast), S15 (the English \"Fuwa Fuwa Time\" video) and S18 (the 2009 Yokohama Arena live) had no pair and fell on episodes 12-15, K-On!!'s URA-ON!! shorts (AniDB 7307), and 18 \"K-ON!: The Movie\" (AniDB 8280). They are unmapped with the other extras S10, S11, S16, S17 and S19. TMDB 42253 season 0: E1 Winter Days! = S1, E2-E8 URA-ON! Yui's Curiosity Series to Winter's... Chapter = S3-S9, E9 Live House! = S2; it lists none of S10-S19 (interviews, English music videos, the 2009 live). With no TMDB row S1-S19 took E1-E19.",
